From 18e3c7c844f3176ae982512a4e4a448fe07efdbf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kvmem <kvmem@local>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:31:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(nvfp4): serve the DFlash2 drafter's NVFP4
 projections

The dynamic grouped conv finish only accepted Q8, so an NVFP4 DFlash2 companion failed warmup with 'linear dynamic grouped conv add: invalid projection_weight'. Accept an NVFP4 parent by n/k and route it through the materialized linear + conv finish, which already handles every format the linear dispatcher supports.

Conversion: dflash2_import_nvfp4.py imports an already-encoded ModelOpt NVFP4 draft verbatim (skipping QKV, conv kernels, the feature projection and the selector hidden projection); dflash2_nvfp4.py keeps the convolution kernel projection BF16 for the same engine constraint.
---
 src/ops/wrapper/dynamic_grouped_conv.cpp      | 16 +++++++++
 tools/convert/recipes/dflash2_import_nvfp4.py | 35 +++++++++++++++++++
 tools/convert/recipes/dflash2_nvfp4.py        | 32 +++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 83 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 tools/convert/recipes/dflash2_import_nvfp4.py
 create mode 100644 tools/convert/recipes/dflash2_nvfp4.py

